<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Tech Pack — {{docNo}}</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/base.css">
<style>
  /* Template-local only — the precedent is challan's .copymark. Base tokens only,
     no colour literals, and nothing here overrides a base rule.

     1. Image plates: base.css has no vocabulary for pictures. This is the only
        kf document that carries any, so the grid lives with the document.
     2. td.fill: base hatches whole ROWS (.open td) and free-text boxes
        (.open-box). A measurement chart needs the same hatch on a single CELL —
        a spec can be known at one size and open at another. Same gradient,
        same meaning: a human writes here after printing. */
  .plates{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(54mm,1fr)); gap:9px;}
  .plate{border:1px solid var(--rule); background:var(--wash); padding:6px;}
  .plate img{display:block; margin:0 auto; width:100%; max-width:64mm; height:64mm;
             object-fit:contain; background:var(--paper);}
  .plate .cap{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:8px; letter-spacing:1.2px;
              text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--ink-2); text-align:center; margin-top:5px;}
  .plate .cap b{color:var(--ink); font-weight:600;}
  td.fill{background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,transparent,transparent 5px,
          rgba(0,0,0,.028) 5px,rgba(0,0,0,.028) 10px); height:22px;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

{{#each sheets}}
<div class="sheet">

  {{> mast company=../company docTitle="Tech Pack" docNo=../docNo docPill=../docPill}}

  {{#if this.isCover}}
  <!-- 01 ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-h"><span>01 &mdash; Style Identity</span><b>{{../statusBanner}}</b></div>
    <div class="kv">
      <div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Style Name</span><span class="v">{{../styleName}}</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Buyer Ref</span><span class="v">{{#if ../buyerRef}}{{../buyerRef}}{{else}}<span class="muted">&mdash; not issued by buyer</span>{{/if}}</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Customer</span><span class="v">{{../customerName}}</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Brand</span><span class="v">{{../brandName}}</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Category</span><span class="v">{{../category}}</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Product Cat.</span><span class="v">{{../productCategory}}</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Components</span><span class="v">{{../componentSummary}}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Season</span><span class="v">{{../season}}</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Gender</span><span class="v">{{../gender}}</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Style Status</span><span class="v">{{../styleStatus}} &middot; <span class="muted">CAD {{../cadStatus}}{{#if ../cadApprovedOn}}, approved {{../cadApprovedOn}}{{/if}}</span></span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Latest Sample</span><span class="v">{{../latestSample}}</span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Codes</span><span class="v">{{#if ../internalCode}}{{../internalCode}}{{else}}&mdash;{{/if}}{{#if ../accountingSku}} &middot; <span class="muted">SKU {{../accountingSku}}</span>{{/if}}{{#if ../hsnCode}} &middot; <span class="muted">HSN {{../hsnCode}}</span>{{/if}}</span></div>
        {{#if ../projectGroup}}<div class="row"><span class="k">Project</span><span class="v">{{../projectGroup}}</span></div>{{/if}}
        {{#if ../expectedOrderQty}}<div class="row"><span class="k">Exp. Order</span><span class="v">{{../expectedOrderQty}} pcs</span></div>{{/if}}
        <div class="row"><span class="k">Dates</span><span class="v">Created {{../createdOn}} &middot; <span class="muted">last revised {{../updatedOn}}</span></span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 02 ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-h"><span>02 &mdash; Size Run &amp; Colourways</span><b>{{../colourwaySource}}</b></div>
    <div class="kv" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;">
      <div><div class="row"><span class="k">Size Run</span><span class="v">{{../sizeRun}}</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <table style="margin-top:8px;">
      <thead>
        <tr><th style="width:34px">#</th><th>Colourway</th><th style="width:70px">Colour Code</th>
            <th>Sizes Carried</th><th class="num" style="width:56px">SKUs</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {{#if ../colourways.length}}
        {{#each ../colourways}}
        <tr><td class="num">{{this.sn}}</td><td>{{this.colour}}</td><td>{{this.code}}</td><td>{{this.sizes}}</td><td class="num">{{this.skus}}</td></tr>
        {{/each}}
        {{else}}
        <tr class="open"><td class="num">1</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        <tr class="open"><td class="num">2</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        <tr class="open"><td class="num">3</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        {{/if}}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <!-- 03 ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-h"><span>03 &mdash; Image Plates</span><b>{{#if ../plates.length}}{{../plates.length}} plate(s){{else}}None on file{{/if}}</b></div>
    {{#if ../plates.length}}
    <div class="plates">
      {{#each ../plates}}
      <div class="plate">
        <img src="{{this.src}}" alt="{{this.label}}">
        <div class="cap"><b>{{this.label}}</b>{{#if this.caption}}<br>{{this.caption}}{{/if}}</div>
      </div>
      {{/each}}
    </div>
    {{else}}
    <div class="callout">
      <b>No plate printed</b>
      {{../platesNote}}
      A tech pack without a front, back and detail view is not fit to cut against &mdash; the pattern master
      is entitled to refuse it.
    </div>
    {{/if}}
  </div>
  {{/if}}

  {{#if this.isBom}}
  {{#if this.showFabric}}
  <!-- 04 ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-h"><span>04 &mdash; Fabric &amp; Cutting</span><b>Consumption per garment</b></div>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th style="width:26px">#</th><th style="width:64px">Component</th><th>Fabric</th>
            <th style="width:78px">Composition</th><th style="width:68px">Constr. / Yarn</th>
            <th class="num" style="width:38px">GSM</th><th class="num" style="width:58px">Width</th>
            <th style="width:88px">Finish &middot; Colour</th><th class="num" style="width:52px">Cons.</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {{#if this.fabricRows.length}}
        {{#each this.fabricRows}}
        <tr><td class="num">{{this.sn}}</td><td>{{this.component}}</td>
            <td>{{this.fabric}}{{#if this.subline}}<br><span class="muted">{{this.subline}}</span>{{/if}}</td>
            <td>{{this.composition}}</td><td>{{this.construction}}</td><td class="num">{{this.gsm}}</td>
            <td class="num">{{this.width}}</td><td>{{this.finish}}</td><td class="num">{{this.consumption}}</td></tr>
        {{/each}}
        <tr class="tot"><td colspan="8">Total fabric per garment &mdash; metres, from approved CAD only</td><td class="num">{{this.fabricTotal}}</td></tr>
        {{else}}
        <tr class="open"><td class="num">1</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        <tr class="open"><td class="num">2</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        {{/if}}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    {{#unless this.fabricRows.length}}
    <div class="callout">
      <b>No fabric is linked to this style</b>
      Nothing can be planned, costed or cut from this pack until fabric is attached to each component
      and a CAD average is approved. The rows above are open for a hand-written interim spec only.
    </div>
    {{/unless}}
  </div>
  {{/if}}

  <!-- 05 ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-h"><span>05 &mdash; Trims, Accessories &amp; Value Addition</span><b>{{#if this.continued}}Continued{{else}}Quantity per garment{{/if}}</b></div>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th style="width:26px">#</th><th>Item</th><th style="width:76px">Type</th>
            <th style="width:80px">Usage</th><th class="num" style="width:60px">Qty / Gmt</th>
            <th style="width:48px">Unit</th><th class="num" style="width:52px">Extra</th><th style="width:96px">Remark</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {{#if this.trimRows.length}}
        {{#each this.trimRows}}
        <tr><td class="num">{{this.sn}}</td>
            <td>{{this.item}}{{#if this.subline}}<br><span class="muted">{{this.subline}}</span>{{/if}}</td>
            <td>{{this.type}}</td><td>{{this.usage}}</td><td class="num">{{this.qty}}</td>
            <td>{{this.unit}}</td><td class="num">{{this.wastage}}</td><td class="muted">{{this.remark}}</td></tr>
        {{/each}}
        {{else}}
        <tr class="open"><td class="num">1</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        <tr class="open"><td class="num">2</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        <tr class="open"><td class="num">3</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        {{/if}}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    {{#if this.trimNote}}
    <div class="callout">
      <b>Read before raising materials</b>
      {{this.trimNote}}
    </div>
    {{/if}}
  </div>
  {{/if}}

  {{#if this.isMeasure}}
  <!-- 06 ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-h"><span>06 &mdash; Measurement Chart{{#if this.continued}} (cont.){{/if}}</span><b>{{../measureBanner}}</b></div>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Point of Measure</th><th class="num" style="width:46px">Tol. &plusmn;</th>
            {{#each this.measureSizes}}<th class="num" style="width:52px">{{this}}</th>{{/each}}</tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {{#each this.measureBlocks}}
        <tr class="sub"><td colspan="{{../measureColspan}}">{{this.title}}{{#if this.note}} &mdash; <span class="muted">{{this.note}}</span>{{/if}}</td></tr>
        {{#each this.rows}}
        <tr><td>{{this.point}}</td>
            {{#if this.tolerance}}<td class="num">{{this.tolerance}}</td>{{else}}<td class="num fill"></td>{{/if}}
            {{#each this.values}}{{#if this}}<td class="num">{{this}}</td>{{else}}<td class="num fill"></td>{{/if}}{{/each}}</tr>
        {{/each}}
        {{/each}}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    {{#if this.showMeasureCallout}}
    <div class="callout">
      <b>Chart issued blank &mdash; on purpose</b>
      No approved measurement set exists for this style, so no figure is printed. Hatched cells are filled by
      the pattern master in ink, against the sealed sample, and the sheet is signed below. A typed-in guess
      here becomes a shipment-wide rejection, which is why nothing is pre-filled.
      All measurements in inches unless the row states otherwise; tolerance is the full &plusmn; band.
    </div>
    {{/if}}
  </div>
  {{/if}}

  {{#if this.isNotes}}
  <!-- 07 ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-h"><span>07 &mdash; Construction &amp; Finishing</span><b>{{#if ../handFillNotes}}To be written on this sheet{{else}}From style record{{/if}}</b></div>
    {{#if ../specRows.length}}
    <div class="kv">
      {{#each ../specRows}}
      <div><div class="row"><span class="k">{{this.label}}</span><span class="v">{{this.value}}</span></div></div>
      {{/each}}
    </div>
    {{/if}}
    {{#each ../noteBlocks}}
    <div class="muted" style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; margin-top:9px; margin-bottom:3px;">{{this.title}}</div>
    <ol class="terms">
      {{#each this.lines}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}
    </ol>
    {{/each}}
    {{#if ../handFillNotes}}
    <div class="muted" style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; margin-top:4px; margin-bottom:4px;">Stitching, seam &amp; finishing instructions</div>
    <div class="open-box" style="min-height:88px;"></div>
    {{/if}}
    {{#if ../processRows.length}}
    <table style="margin-top:10px;">
      <thead>
        <tr><th style="width:26px">#</th><th>Process Step</th><th style="width:90px">Type</th>
            <th style="width:70px">Requirement</th><th class="num" style="width:48px">Days</th>
            <th style="width:100px">Partner</th><th style="width:96px">Notes</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {{#each ../processRows}}
        <tr><td class="num">{{this.sn}}</td><td>{{this.process}}</td><td>{{this.kind}}</td>
            <td>{{this.required}}</td><td class="num">{{this.days}}</td><td>{{this.partner}}</td>
            <td class="muted">{{this.notes}}</td></tr>
        {{/each}}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    {{/if}}
  </div>

  <!-- 08 ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-h"><span>08 &mdash; Packing &amp; Labelling</span><b>{{#if ../packIsBlank}}Not specified &mdash; agree with buyer{{else}}From style record{{/if}}</b></div>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th style="width:26px">#</th><th>Item</th><th style="width:96px">Type</th>
            <th>Specification</th><th class="num" style="width:44px">Qty</th><th style="width:82px">Basis</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {{#if ../packRows.length}}
        {{#each ../packRows}}
        <tr><td class="num">{{this.sn}}</td><td>{{this.item}}</td><td>{{this.kind}}</td><td>{{this.spec}}</td><td class="num">{{this.qty}}</td><td class="muted">{{this.basis}}</td></tr>
        {{/each}}
        {{else}}
        <tr class="open"><td class="num">1</td><td>Polybag &mdash; size &amp; print</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        <tr class="open"><td class="num">2</td><td>Main label / care label placement</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        <tr class="open"><td class="num">3</td><td>Hangtag &amp; price sticker</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        <tr class="open"><td class="num">4</td><td>Carton &amp; shipping marks</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        {{/if}}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <!-- 09 ───────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="sec">
    <div class="sec-h"><span>09 &mdash; Sample &amp; Fit Approval</span><b>{{#if ../sampleIsBlank}}No sample on record{{else}}{{../sampleRows.length}} on record{{/if}}</b></div>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th style="width:26px">#</th><th style="width:100px">Sample No.</th><th style="width:96px">Type</th>
            <th style="width:96px">Status</th><th style="width:74px">Requested</th>
            <th style="width:74px">Completed</th><th>Fit Comment / Action</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {{#if ../sampleRows.length}}
        {{#each ../sampleRows}}
        <tr><td class="num">{{this.sn}}</td><td>{{this.sampleNo}}</td><td>{{this.kind}}</td><td>{{this.status}}</td>
            <td>{{this.requested}}</td><td>{{this.completed}}</td><td class="muted">{{this.feedback}}</td></tr>
        {{/each}}
        {{else}}
        <tr class="open"><td class="num">1</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        <tr class="open"><td class="num">2</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        <tr class="open"><td class="num">3</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
        {{/if}}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <ol class="terms" style="margin-top:9px;">
      <li>This pack, once signed below, is the only authority for cutting. Any change &mdash; fabric, trim, measurement or finishing &mdash; requires a reissued pack with a later revision date; a verbal instruction is not a change.</li>
      <li>Measurements are checked against the sealed sample at the pre-production meeting. Discrepancies are recorded on this sheet before bulk cutting starts.</li>
      <li>Trims must match the approved trim card. Substitutions require written approval from merchandising.</li>
      <li>All quantities on this pack are per garment. Wastage percentages are planning allowances, not licence to over-issue.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="sign">
    <div>Designer &mdash; issued</div>
    <div>Pattern Master &mdash; measurements filled &amp; verified</div>
    <div>Merchandiser &mdash; approved for production</div>
  </div>
  {{/if}}

  <div class="foot">
    <span>Tech Pack {{../docNo}} &middot; Page {{this.pageNo}} of {{../pageTotal}}</span>
    <span>{{../company.name}} &middot; revised {{../updatedOn}} &middot; supersedes all earlier packs</span>
  </div>
</div>
{{/each}}

</body>
</html>
